# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IP boundary — deliberately NOT published.
#
# ECM-EKF/ holds the Simulink DEKF model, the parameter-identification
# pipeline and identified cell parameters. That pipeline is the actual product
# (models are commodity; commissioning a new cell is not), and some of the
# source data comes from a partner project. This repository is public, so the
# whole folder stays out of it.
#
# It is therefore NOT backed up by this repo. Keep a separate private backup.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
ECM-EKF/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw measurement data — never published.
#
# Tens of GB of cycler exports, some of it from partner projects. Large, not
# ours to redistribute, and pointless in git. Only the small curated JSON in
# frontend/public/results/ is published, and that is written by the export
# scripts, not copied from here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
data/
*.xlsb
*.xlk

# Working notes and internal planning. Not documentation, and they reference
# partner-project names and local paths that should not be published.
diary.md
ROADMAP.md

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Ordinary build / tooling noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
*.local
.vite/
*.tsbuildinfo

# Editors / OS
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp

# Logs
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# MATLAB / Simulink artefacts, wherever they land
*.mat
*.slxc
*.asv
*.autosave
slprj/

# Local Claude Code tooling config (dev-server launch settings). Machine-local,
# not part of the published project.
.claude/
